### CDN Configuration Best Practices
```nginx
# Cache-Control headers for different content types
location ~* \.(js|css|png|jpg|jpeg|gif|ico|svg|woff2)$ {
    expires 1y;
    add_header Cache-Control "public, immutable";
    add_header Vary "Accept-Encoding";
